ront page.'=>'已通知 LiteSpeed Web Server 清除首页。','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge all pages.'=>'已通知 LiteSpeed Web Server 清除所有页面。','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge error pages.'=>'已通知 LiteSpeed Web Server 清除错误页面。','Purge category %s'=>'清除分类 %s','Purge tag %s'=>'清除标签 %s','Purge url %s'=>'清除网址 %s','All QUIC.cloud service queues have been cleared.'=>'所有 QUIC.cloud 服务队列均已清空。','Every 15 Minutes'=>'每15分钟','LiteSpeed Crawler Cron'=>'LiteSpeed 爬虫 Cron 定时任务','Failed to detect IP'=>'无法检测IP','right now'=>'目前','just now'=>'刚刚',' %s ago'=>'%s前','Please consider disabling the following detected plugins, as they may conflict with Zinn® Cache Engine:'=>'请考虑禁用以下检测到的插件，因为它们可能与 Zinn® Cache Engine 发生冲突：','WooCommerce Settings'=>'WooCommerce 设置','NOTICE:'=>'注意：','After verifying that the cache works in general, please test the cart.'=>'在验证缓存总体上能够正常工作之后，请测试购物车。','To test the cart, visit the %sFAQ%s.'=>'若要测试购物车，请访问 %sFAQ%s。','By default, the My Account, Checkout, and Cart pages are automatically excluded from caching. Misconfiguration of page associations in WooCommerce settings may cause some pages to be erroneously excluded.'=>'默认情况下，“我的账户”、“结账”和“购物车”页面会自动排除在缓存之外。WooCommerce 设置中的页面关联配置错误可能会导致某些页面被错误地排除。','Product Update Interval'=>'产品更新间隔','Purge product on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'当数量或库存状态发生更改时清除产品缓存。','Purge categories only when stock status changes.'=>'仅在库存状态更改时清除分类缓存。','Purge product and categories only when the stock status changes.'=>'仅在库存状态发生变化时清除产品和分类。','Purge product only when the stock status changes.'=>'仅在库存状态发生变化时清除产品。','Do not purge categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'更改数量或库存状态时，请勿清除分类。','Always purge both product and categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'当数量或库存状态发生更改时，务必同时清除产品和分类的缓存。','Determines how changes in product quantity and product stock status affect product pages and their associated category pages.'=>'确定产品数量和产品库存状态的变化如何影响产品页面及其关联的分类页面。','Vary for Mini Cart'=>'针对迷你购物车进行变体','Generate a separate vary cache copy for the mini cart when the cart is not empty.'=>'当购物车不为空时，为迷你购物车生成单独的 vary 缓存副本。','If your theme does not use JS to update the mini cart, you must enable this option to display the correct cart contents.'=>'如果您的主题未使用 JS 更新迷你购物车，则必须启用此选项才能显示正确的购物车内容。','New Developer Version Available!'=>'有新的开发者版本可用！','New developer version %s is available now.'=>'新开发者版本 %s 现已可用。','Upgrade'=>'升级','Purge'=>'清理','Excludes'=>'排除','Object'=>'对象','Browser'=>'浏览器','Advanced'=>'高级','Zinn® Cache Engine Network Cache Settings'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎网络缓存设置','TTL'=>'TTL','ESI'=>'ESI','Zinn® Cache Engine Settings'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎设置','NOTE'=>'备注','More settings available under %s menu'=>'更多设置可在 %s 菜单中找到','Advanced Settings'=>'高级设置','Cache Control Settings'=>'缓存控制设置','Network Enable Cache'=>'启用网络缓存','Enabling Zinn® Cache Engine for WordPress here enables the cache for the network.'=>'在此处为 WordPress 启用 Zinn® Cache Engine 将为整个网络启用缓存。','It is STRONGLY recommended that the compatibility with other plugins on a single/few sites is tested first.'=>'强烈建议首先在单个或少数几个站点上测试与其他插件的兼容性。','This is to ensure compatibility prior to enabling the cache for all sites.'=>'这是为了在为所有站点启用缓存之前确保兼容性。','Exclude Settings'=>'排除设置','Purge Settings'=>'清除设置','These settings are meant for ADVANCED USERS ONLY.'=>'这些设置仅供高级用户使用。','Specify an AJAX action in POST/GET and the number of seconds to cache that request, separated by a space.'=>'请在 POST/GET 中指定 AJAX 操作以及缓存该请求的秒数，两者之间用空格隔开。','Enable this option if you are using both HTTP and HTTPS in the same domain and are noticing cache irregularities.'=>'如果您在同一域中同时使用 HTTP 和 HTTPS 并注意到缓存异常，请启用此选项。','When a visitor hovers over a page link, preload that page. This will speed up the visit to that link.'=>'当访客将鼠标悬停在页面链接上时，预加载该页面。这将加快对该链接的访问速度。','This will generate extra requests to the server, which will increase server load.'=>'这会向服务器产生额外请求，从而增加服务器负载。','Use Network Admin Setting'=>'使用网络管理员设置','Please visit the %sInformation%s page on how to test the cache.'=>'请访问 %sInformation%s 页面了解如何测试缓存。','NOTICE'=>'注意','When disabling the cache, all cached entries for this site will be purged.'=>'禁用缓存时，该站点所有已缓存的条目都将被清除。','The network admin setting can be overridden here.'=>'可以在此处覆盖网络管理员设置。','Privately cache frontend pages for logged-in users. (LSWS %s required)'=>'为已登录用户私有缓存前端页面。（需要 LSWS %s）','Privately cache commenters that have pending comments. Disabling this option will serve non-cacheable pages to commenters. (LSWS %s required)'=>'私密缓存有待审核评论的评论者。禁用此选项将向评论者提供不可缓存的页面。（需要 LSWS %s）','Cache requests made by WordPress REST API calls.'=>'缓存由 WordPress REST API 调用发起的请求。','Disabling this option may negatively affect performance.'=>'禁用此选项可能会对性能产生负面影响。','URI Paths containing these strings will NOT be cached as public.'=>'包含这些字符串的 URI 路径将不会被缓存为公开。','Paths containing these strings will be cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'包含这些字符串的路径将被缓存，不论无缓存设置如何。','To define a custom TTL for a URI, add a space followed by the TTL value to the end of the URI.'=>'若要为 URI 定义自定义 TTL，请在 URI 末尾添加一个空格及 TTL 值。','For example, %1$s defines a TTL of %2$s seconds for %3$s.'=>'例如，%1$s 为 %3$s 定义了 %2$s 秒的 TTL。','Paths containing these strings will be forced to public cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'包含这些字符串的路径将被强制设置为公共缓存，无论是否设置了不可缓存。','ESI Settings'=>'ESI 设置','With ESI (Edge Side Includes), pages may be served from cache for logged-in users.'=>'借助 ESI (Edge Side Includes)，已登录用户也可以从缓存中加载页面。','ESI allows you to designate parts of your dynamic page as separate fragments that are then assembled together to make the whole page. In other words, ESI lets you “punch holes” in a page, and then fill those holes with content that may be cached privately, cached publicly with its own TTL, or not cached at all.'=>'ESI 允许您将动态页面的各个部分指定为独立的片段，然后将这些片段组合在一起来构建整个页面。换句话说，ESI 允许您在页面中“打孔”，然后使用可以进行私有缓存、具有各自 TTL 的公共缓存或完全不缓存的内容来填充这些孔。','WpW: Private Cache vs. Public Cache'=>'WpW：私有缓存与公共缓存','You can turn shortcodes into ESI blocks.'=>'您可以将短代码转换为 ESI 块。','Replace %1$s with %2$s.'=>'用 %2$s 替换 %1$s。','ESI sample for developers'=>'开发人员 ESI 示例','WARNING'=>'警告','These options are only available with LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server.'=>'这些选项仅在 LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server 上可用。','Turn ON to cache public pages for logged in users, and serve the Admin Bar and Comment Form via ESI blocks. These two blocks will be uncached unless enabled below.'=>'开启此项以缓存已登录用户的公共页面，并通过 ESI 块提供管理工具栏和评论表单。这两个块将保持不缓存状态，除非在下方启用。','Cache the built-in Admin Bar ESI block.'=>'缓存内置的 Admin Bar ESI 块。','Cache the built-in Comment Form ESI block.'=>'缓存内置的评论表单 ESI 块。','The list will be merged with the predefined nonces in your local data file.'=>'该列表将与您本地数据文件中的预定义随机数合并。','The latest data file is'=>'最新数据文件是','Filter %s is supported.'=>'支持筛选器 %s。','The above nonces will be converted to ESI automatically.'=>'以上 nonces 将被自动转换为 ESI。','An optional second parameter may be used to specify cache control. Use a space to separate'=>'可使用可选的第二个参数来指定缓存控制。请用空格隔开','Wildcard %1$s supported (match zero or more characters). For example, to match %2$s and %3$s, use %4$s.'=>'支持通配符 %1$s（匹配零个或多个字符）。例如，要匹配 %2$s 和 %3$s，请使用 %4$s。','If your site contains public content that certain user roles can see but other roles cannot, you can specify a Vary Group for those user roles. For example, specifying an administrator vary group allows there to be a separate publicly-cached page tailored to administrators (with “edit” links, etc), while all other user roles see the default public page.'=>'如果您的网站包含某些用户角色可见而其他角色不可见的公开内容，您可以为这些用户角色指定一个 Vary 组。例如，指定一个管理员 Vary 组可以生成一个专门为管理员量身定制的独立公开缓存页面（带有“编辑”链接等），而所有其他用户角色则会看到默认的公开页面。','Paths containing these strings will not be cached.'=>'包含这些字符串的路径将不会被缓存。','Predefined list will also be combined w/ the above settings'=>'预定义列表也将与上述设置合并','Query strings containing these parameters will not be cached.'=>'包含这些参数的查询字符串将不会被缓存。','For example, for %1$s, %2$s and %3$s can be used here.'=>'例如，对于 %1$s，此处可使用 %2$s 和 %3$s。','All categories are cached by default.'=>'默认情况下，所有分类都会被缓存。','To prevent %s from being cached, enter them here.'=>'若要防止 %s 被缓存，请在此处输入。','categories'=>'分类','If the category name is not found, the category will be removed from the list on save.'=>'如果未找到分类名称，保存时该分类将从列表中移除。','All tags are cached by default.'=>'所有标签默认均已缓存。','tags'=>'标签','If the tag slug is not found, the tag will be removed from the list on save.'=>'如果找不到标签别名，保存时该标签将从列表中移除。','To exclude %1$s, insert %2$s.'=>'要排除 %1$s，请插入 %2$s。','Selected roles will be excluded from cache.'=>'所选角色将被排除在缓存之外。','All pages'=>'所有页面','Front page'=>'首页','Home page'=>'主页','Pages'=>'页面','All pages with Recent Posts Widget'=>'包含“近期文章”小组件的所有页面','Author archive'=>'作者存档','Post type archive'=>'文章类型归档','Yearly archive'=>'年度归档','Monthly archive'=>'每月归档','Daily archive'=>'每日归档','Term archive (include category, tag, and tax)'=>'术语存档（包括分类、标签和税项）','Auto Purge Rules For Publish/Update'=>'发布/更新时的自动清除规则','Note'=>'备注','Select "All" if there are dynamic widgets linked to posts on pages other than the front or home pages.'=>'如果首页或主页以外的页面上有链接到文章的动态小部件，请选择“全部”。','Other checkboxes will be ignored.'=>'其他复选框将被忽略。','Select only the archive types that are currently used, the others can be left unchecked.'=>'仅选择当前使用的存档类型，其余的不勾选即可。','Select which pages will be automatically purged when posts are published/updated.'=>'选择在发布或更新文章时要自动清除缓存的页面。','If ON, the stale copy of a cached page will be shown to visitors until a new cache copy is available. Reduces the server load for following visits. If OFF, the page will be dynamically generated while visitors wait.'=>'如果开启，将向访问者显示缓存页面的过期副本，直到有新的缓存副本可用。可减少后续访问的服务器负载。如果关闭，页面将动态生成，访问者需等待其完成。','By design, this option may serve stale content. Do not enable this option, if that is not OK with you.'=>'出于设计原因，此选项可能会提供陈旧的内容。如果您无法接受这一点，请不要启用此选项。','The URLs here (one per line) will be purged automatically at the time set in the option "%s".'=>'此处列出的网址（每行一个）将根据选项 "%s" 中设置的时间自动清除。','Both %1$s and %2$s are acceptable.'=>'%1$s和%2$s两者皆可。','For URLs with wildcards, there may be a delay in initiating scheduled purge.'=>'对于包含通配符的 URL，启动计划清除可能会有延迟。','Specify the time to purge the "%s" list.'=>'指定清除 "%s" 列表的时间。','Current server time is %s.'=>'当前服务器时间为 %s。','A Purge All will be executed when WordPress runs these hooks.'=>'当 WordPress 运行这些钩子时，将执行全部清除。','Specify how long, in seconds, public pages are cached.'=>'指定公共页面的缓存时间（以秒为单位）。','Specify how long, in seconds, private pages are cached.'=>'请指定私密页面缓存的时长（以秒为单位）。','Specify how long, in seconds, the front page is cached.'=>'指定首页缓存的时长（以秒为单位）。','Specify how long, in seconds, feeds are cached.'=>'请指定 Feed 缓存的时长（以秒为单位）。','If this is set to a number less than 30, feeds will not be cached.'=>'如果将其设置为小于 30 的数字，则不会缓存订阅源。','Specify how long, in seconds, REST calls are cached.'=>'指定 REST 调用的缓存时间（以秒为单位）。','Specify an HTTP status code and the number of seconds to cache that page, separated by a space.'=>'指定 HTTP 状态码和缓存该页面的秒数，两者之间用空格分隔。','Browser Cache Settings'=>'浏览器缓存设置','OpenLiteSpeed users please check this'=>'OpenLiteSpeed 用户请注意此项','Setting Up Custom Headers'=>'正在设置自定义标头','Browser caching stores static files locally in the user\'s browser. Turn on this setting to reduce repeated requests for static files.'=>'浏览器缓存将静态文件本地存储在用户的浏览器中。开启此设置可减少对静态文件的重复请求。','You can turn on browser caching in server admin too. %sLearn more about LiteSpeed browser cache settings%s.'=>'您也可以在服务器管理中启用浏览器缓存。%s了解有关 LiteSpeed 浏览器缓存设置的更多信息%s。','The amount of time, in seconds, that files will be stored in browser cache before expiring.'=>'文件在浏览器缓存中存储过期前的时间长度（以秒为单位）。','Ignore certain query strings when caching. (LSWS %s required)'=>'缓存时忽略特定查询字符串。（需要 LSWS %s）','For example, to drop parameters beginning with %1$s, %2$s can be used here.'=>'例如，若要删除以 %1$s 开头的参数，此处可以使用 %2$s。','Serve a separate cache copy for mobile visitors.'=>'为移动端访客提供单独的缓存副本。','Learn more about when this is needed'=>'了解何时需要此项操作','Htaccess did not match configuration option.'=>'Htaccess 未能匹配配置选项。','Htaccess rule is: %s'=>'.htaccess 规则为：%s','If %1$s is %2$s, then %3$s must be populated!'=>'如果 %1$s 为 %2$s，则必须填写 %3$s！','user agents'=>'用户代理','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive. MUST BE UNIQUE FROM OTHER WEB APPLICATIONS.'=>'语法：字母数字和“_”。不允许有空格且区分大小写。必须与其他 Web 应用程序不同。','The default login cookie is %s.'=>'默认登录 Cookie 为 %s。','The server will determine if the user is logged in based on the existence of this cookie.'=>'服务器将根据此 cookie 的存在与否来判断用户是否已登录。','This setting is useful for those that have multiple web applications for the same domain.'=>'此设置适用于在同一域名下拥有多个网络应用程序的用户。','If every web application uses the same cookie, the server may confuse whether a user is logged in or not.'=>'如果每个 Web 应用程序都使用相同的 Cookie，服务器可能会分不清用户是否已登录。','The cookie set here will be used for this WordPress installation.'=>'此处设置的 cookie 将用于此 WordPress 安装。','Example use case:'=>'示例用例：','There is a WordPress installed for %s.'=>'已为 %s 安装了 WordPress。','Then another WordPress is installed (NOT MULTISITE) at %s'=>'然后，在 %s 处安装了另一个 WordPress（非多站点）','The cache needs to distinguish who is logged into which WordPress site in order to cache correctly.'=>'缓存需要区分谁登录了哪个 WordPress 网站，以便进行正确的缓存。','Invalid login cookie. Invalid characters found.'=>'登录 Cookie 无效。发现无效字符。','WARNING: The .htaccess login cookie and Database login cookie do not match.'=>'警告：.htaccess 登录 Cookie 与数据库登录 Cookie 不匹配。','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive.'=>'语法：字母数字和“_”。不允许空格且区分大小写。','You can list the 3rd party vary cookies here.'=>'您可以在此处列出第三方 vary Cookie。','Enabled'=>'已启用','Disabled'=>'已禁用','Not Available'=>'不可用','Passed'=>'已通过','Failed'=>'失败','Object Cache Settings'=>'对象缓存设置','Use external object cache functionality.'=>'使用外部对象缓存功能。','Status'=>'状态','%s Extension'=>'%s 扩展','Connection Test'=>'连接测试','Your %s Hostname or IP address.'=>'您的 %s 主机名或 IP 地址。','If you are using a %1$s socket, %2$s should be set to %3$s'=>'如果您正在使用 %1$s 套接字，%2$s 应设置为 %3$s','Default port for %1$s is %2$s.'=>'%1$s 的默认端口是 %2$s。','Default TTL for cached objects.'=>'缓存对象的默认 TTL。','Only available when %s is installed.'=>'仅在安装 %s 时可用。','Specify the password used when connecting.'=>'请指定连接时使用的密码。','Database to be used'=>'要使用的数据库','Groups cached at the network level.'=>'网络层已缓存组。','Use keep-alive connections to speed up cache operations.'=>'使用保持活动连接来加速缓存操作。','Improve wp-admin speed through caching. (May encounter expired data)'=>'通过缓存提升 wp-admin 的运行速度。（可能会遇到过期数据）','When enabled, the cache will automatically purge when any plugin, theme or the WordPress core is upgraded.'=>'启用后，当升级任何插件、主题或 WordPress 核心时，缓存将自动清除。','Cloudflare Settings'=>'Cloudflare 设置','Use %s API functionality.'=>'使用 %s API 功能。','Global API Key / API Token'=>'全局 API 密钥 / API 令牌','Your API key / token is used to access %s APIs.'=>'您的 API 密钥 / 令牌用于访问 %s API。','Get it from %s.'=>'从 %s 获取。','Recommended to generate the token from Cloudflare API token template "WordPress".'=>'建议使用 Cloudflare API 令牌模板“WordPress”生成令牌。','Email Address'=>'电子邮箱地址','Your Email address on %s.'=>'您在 %s 上的电子邮件地址。','Optional when API token used.'=>'使用API令牌时可选。','Domain'=>'域','You can just type part of the domain.'=>'您只需输入域名的部分字符即可。','Once saved, it will be matched with the current list and completed automatically.'=>'保存后，系统将将其与当前列表进行匹配并自动完成。','Clear %s cache when "Purge All" is run.'=>'运行“全部清除”时清除 %s 缓存。','To enable the following functionality, turn ON Cloudflare API in CDN Settings.'=>'要启用以下功能，请在 CDN 设置中开启 Cloudflare API。','Cloudflare Domain'=>'Cloudflare 域名','Cloudflare Zone'=>'Cloudflare 区域','Development Mode'=>'开发模式','Turn ON'=>'开启','Turn OFF'=>'关闭','Check Status'=>'检查状态','Current status is %1$s since %2$s.'=>'自 %2$s 起，当前状态为 %1$s。','Current status is %s.'=>'当前状态为 %s。','Development mode will be automatically turned off in %s.'=>'开发模式将在 %s 后自动关闭。','Temporarily bypass Cloudflare cache. This allows changes to the origin server to be seen in realtime.'=>'暂时绕过 Cloudflare 缓存。这允许实时查看对源服务器所做的更改。','Development Mode will be turned off automatically after three hours.'=>'开发模式将在三小时后自动关闭。','%1$sLearn More%2$s'=>'%1$s了解详情%2$s','Cloudflare Cache'=>'Cloudflare 缓存','Purge Everything'=>'全部清除','Other Static CDN'=>'其他静态 CDN','Zinn® Cache Engine CDN'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎 CDN','CDN Settings'=>'CDN 设置','Turn this setting %s if you are using a traditional Content Delivery Network (CDN) or a subdomain for static content.'=>'如果您正在使用传统的 内容分发网络 (CDN) 或用于静态内容的子域，请将此设置设为 %s。','NOTE: Cloudflare does not use CDN Mapping. If you are only using Cloudflare, leave this setting %s.'=>'注意：Cloudflare 不使用 CDN 映射。如果您仅使用 Cloudflare，请将此设置保留为 %s。','To randomize CDN hostname, define multiple hostnames for the same resources.'=>'要随机化 CDN 主机名，请为同一资源定义多个主机名。','Serve all image files through the CDN. This will affect all attachments, HTML %1$s tags, and CSS %2$s attributes.'=>'通过 CDN 提供所有图像文件的服务。这将会影响所有附件、HTML %1$s 标签以及 CSS %2$s 属性。','Serve all CSS files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP CSS files.'=>'通过 CDN 提供所有 CSS 文件的服务。这将影响所有已排队的 WP CSS 文件。','Serve all JavaScript files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP JavaScript files.'=>'通过 CDN 提供所有 JavaScript 文件的服务。这将影响所有已排队的 WP JavaScript 文件。','Static file type links to be replaced by CDN links.'=>'要被CDN链接替换的静态文件类型链接。','This will affect all tags containing attributes: %s.'=>'这将会影响包含以下属性的所有标签：%s。','If you turn any of the above settings OFF, please remove the related file types from the %s box.'=>'如果关闭上述任何设置，请从 %s 框中移除相关的文体类型。','Specify which HTML element attributes will be replaced with CDN Mapping.'=>'指定哪些 HTML 元素属性将被 CDN 映射替换。','Only attributes listed here will be replaced.'=>'仅替换此处列出的属性。','Use the format %1$s or %2$s (element is optional).'=>'请使用 %1$s 或 %2$s 格式（元素为可选）。','Site URL to be served through the CDN. Beginning with %1$s. For example, %2$s.'=>'通过 CDN 提供服务的网站 URL。以 %1$s 开头。例如，%2$s。','Only files within these directories will be pointed to the CDN.'=>'只有这些目录中的文件才会被指向 CDN。','Paths containing these strings will not be served from the CDN.'=>'包含这些字符串的路径将不会从 CDN 提供服务。','Are you sure to delete all existing blocklist items?'=>'您确定要删除所有现有的黑名单项目吗？','Empty blocklist'=>'清空阻止列表','Blocklist'=>'黑名单','Total'=>'总计','URL'=>'URL','Operatio