ng revisions.'=>'清理修订版本时，将保留比此天数更新的修订版本。','Public'=>'公开','Private'=>'私密','Disable'=>'禁用','Widget Cache TTL'=>'小组件缓存 TTL','Recommended value: 28800 seconds (8 hours).'=>'推荐值：28800 秒（8 小时）。','A TTL of 0 indicates do not cache.'=>'TTL 为 0 表示不缓存。','General Settings'=>'通用设置','Zinn® Cache Engine General Settings'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎通用设置','Use Primary Site Configuration'=>'使用主要站点配置','Check this option to use the primary site\'s configuration for all subsites.'=>'勾选此选项以将主站点的配置应用于所有子站点。','This will disable the settings page on all subsites.'=>'这将禁用所有子站点的设置页面。','This option enables maximum optimization for Guest Mode visitors.'=>'此选项可为访客模式访问者启用最大程度的优化。','Please read all warnings before enabling this option.'=>'请在启用此选项之前阅读所有警告。','Notice'=>'通知','%s must be turned ON for this setting to work.'=>'必须开启 %s 才能使此设置生效。','You need to turn %s on to get maximum result.'=>'您需要开启 %s 以获得最佳效果。','You need to turn %s on and finish all WebP generation to get maximum result.'=>'您需要开启 %s 并完成所有 WebP 生成以获得最佳效果。','Enter this site\'s IP address to allow cloud services directly call IP instead of domain name. This eliminates the overhead of DNS and CDN lookups.'=>'请输入此网站的 IP 地址，以允许云服务直接调用 IP 而不是域名。这消除了 DNS 和 CDN 查找的开销。','Your server IP'=>'您的服务器 IP','Check my public IP from'=>'检查我的公网 IP 来自','the auto-detected IP may not be accurate if you have an additional outgoing IP set, or you have multiple IPs configured on your server.'=>'如果您设置了额外的出站 IP，或者您的服务器上配置了多个 IP，自动检测到的 IP 可能不准确。','Please make sure this IP is the correct one for visiting your site.'=>'请确保此 IP 是用于访问您网站的正确 IP。','Turn this option ON to show latest news automatically, including hotfixes, new releases, available beta versions, and promotions.'=>'开启此选项可自动显示最新动态，包括热修复、新版本、可用测试版以及促销信息。','Turn this option ON to have Zinn® Cache Engine updated automatically, whenever a new version is released. If OFF, update manually as usual.'=>'开启此选项可在发布新版本时自动更新 Zinn® Cache Engine。若关闭，则按常规进行手动更新。','Guest Mode provides an always cacheable landing page for an automated guest\'s first time visit, and then attempts to update cache varies via AJAX.'=>'访客模式为自动化访客的首次访问提供始终可缓存的落地页，随后尝试通过 AJAX 更新缓存变体。','This option can help to correct the cache vary for certain advanced mobile or tablet visitors.'=>'此选项有助于纠正某些高级手机或平板电脑访问者的缓存变量。','Guest Mode testing result'=>'访客模式测试结果','Testing'=>'测试中','Guest Mode IP/UA sync status'=>'访客模式 IP/UA 同步状态','Syncing'=>'正在同步','Guest Mode passed testing.'=>'访客模式测试已通过。','Guest Mode failed to test.'=>'访客模式测试失败。','Synced successfully.'=>'同步成功。','Sync failed.'=>'同步失败。','Image Optimization Summary'=>'图片优化摘要','Image Optimization Settings'=>'图片优化设置','Zinn® Cache Engine Image Optimization'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎图片优化','Request WebP/AVIF versions of original images when doing optimization.'=>'在进行优化时请求原图的 WebP/AVIF 版本。','Significantly improve load time by replacing images with their optimized %s versions.'=>'通过将图片替换为其优化的 %s 版本，显著缩短加载时间。','When switching formats, please %1$s or %2$s to apply this new choice to previously optimized images.'=>'切换格式时，请使用 %1$s 或 %2$s 将此新选项应用于先前已优化的图片。','Destroy All Optimization Data'=>'销毁所有优化数据','Soft Reset Optimization Counter'=>'软重置优化计数器','Automatically request optimization via cron job.'=>'通过 cron 作业自动请求优化。','Optimize images and save backups of the originals in the same folder.'=>'优化图像并在同一文件夹中保存原件的备份。','Automatically remove the original image backups after fetching optimized images.'=>'获取优化后的图片后，自动删除原图备份。','This is irreversible.'=>'此操作不可逆。','You will be unable to Revert Optimization once the backups are deleted!'=>'备份删除后，您将无法恢复优化！','Optimize images using lossless compression.'=>'使用无损压缩优化图片。','This can improve quality but may result in larger images than lossy compression will.'=>'这可以提高质量，但可能会产生比有损压缩更大的图片。','No sizes found.'=>'未找到大小。','Choose which image sizes to optimize.'=>'选择要优化的图像尺寸。','Preserve EXIF data (copyright, GPS, comments, keywords, etc) when optimizing.'=>'优化时保留EXIF数据（版权、GPS、注释、关键词等）。','This will increase the size of optimized files.'=>'这会增加优化后文件的大小。','Specify which element attributes will be replaced with WebP/AVIF.'=>'指定哪些元素属性将被替换为 WebP/AVIF。','Enable replacement of WebP/AVIF in %s elements that were generated outside of WordPress logic.'=>'启用对在 WordPress 逻辑之外生成的 %s 元素中的 WebP/AVIF 替换。','Current closest Cloud server is %s. Click to redetect.'=>'当前最近的云服务器是 %s。点击重新检测。','Are you sure you want to redetect the closest cloud server for this service?'=>'确定要重新检测此服务的最近云服务器吗？','Redetect'=>'重新检测','Image optimisation'=>'图像优化','You can request a maximum of %s images at once.'=>'您一次最多可以请求 %s 张图片。','To make sure our server can communicate with your server without any issues and everything works fine, for the few first requests the number of image groups allowed in a single request is limited.'=>'为了确保我们的服务器能够与您的服务器顺畅通信并正常运行，在最初的几次请求中，单次请求允许的图像组数量将受到限制。','Current limit is'=>'当前限制为','Send Optimization Request'=>'发送优化请求','Available after %d second(s)'=>'%d 秒后可用','Only press the button if the pull cron job is disabled.'=>'仅当拉取定时任务已禁用时，才可按此按钮。','Images will be pulled automatically if the cron job is running.'=>'如果定时任务正在运行，系统将自动拉取图像。','Pull Images'=>'拉取镜像','Optimization Status'=>'优化状态','When the optimisation server finishes, it notifies your site to pull the optimised images.'=>'当优化服务器完成时，它会通知您的网站拉取优化后的图片。','This process is automatic.'=>'此过程是自动进行的。','Last pull initiated by cron at %s.'=>'由 cron 于 %s 发起的上一次拉取。','Storage Optimization'=>'存储优化','A backup of each image is saved before it is optimized.'=>'在优化之前，每个图像的备份都会被保存。','Last calculated'=>'上次计算','Files'=>'文件','Calculate Original Image Storage'=>'计算原始图片存储空间','Calculate Backups Disk Space'=>'计算备份磁盘空间','Image Thumbnail Group Sizes'=>'图片缩略图组大小','Delete all backups of the original images'=>'删除原始图像的所有备份','Last ran'=>'上次运行','Saved'=>'已保存','Are you sure you want to remove all image backups?'=>'您确定要删除所有图像备份吗？','Remove Original Image Backups'=>'删除原始图像备份','Image Information'=>'图像信息','Image groups total'=>'图像组总计','Congratulations, all gathered!'=>'恭喜，全部收集完毕！','What is a group?'=>'什么是群组？','What is an image group?'=>'什么是图像组？','Current image post id position'=>'当前图片文章 ID 位置','Maximum image post id'=>'最大图片文章编号','Scan for any new unoptimized image thumbnail sizes and resend necessary image optimization requests.'=>'扫描任何新的未优化图像缩略图尺寸，并重新发送必要的图像优化请求。','Rescan New Thumbnails'=>'重新扫描新缩略图','Optimization Summary'=>'优化摘要','Total Reduction'=>'总减免量','Images Pulled'=>'已拉取镜像','Last Request'=>'最后一次请求','Last Pulled'=>'上次拉取','Results can be checked in %sMedia Library%s.'=>'可以在 %s媒体库%s 中查看结果。','Optimization Tools'=>'优化工具','You can quickly switch between using original (unoptimized versions) and optimized image files. It will affect all images on your website, both regular and webp versions if available.'=>'您可以快速在原始（未优化的版本）和优化后的图像文件之间进行切换。这将会影响您网站上的所有图像，包括常规版本和 webp 版本（如果可用）。','Use original images (unoptimized) on your site'=>'在您的网站上使用原图（未优化）','Use Original Files'=>'使用原文件','Switch back to using optimized images on your site'=>'切换回在您的网站上使用优化图片','Use Optimized Files'=>'使用优化的文件','This will reset the %1$s. If you changed WebP/AVIF settings and want to generate %2$s for the previously optimized images, use this action.'=>'这将会重置 %1$s。如果您更改了 WebP/AVIF 设置并希望为以前优化过的图片重新生成 %2$s，请使用此操作。','Are you sure to destroy all optimized images?'=>'您确定要销毁所有优化后的图片吗？','Remove all previous image optimization requests/results, revert completed optimizations, and delete all optimization files.'=>'移除所有先前的图像优化请求/结果，还原已完成的优化，并删除所有优化文件。','Read the upstream Zinn® Cache Engine documentation'=>'阅读上游 Zinn® 缓存引擎文档','Zinn Digital® support'=>'Zinn Digital® 支持','Zinn® Cache Engine user guide'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎用户指南','To use the caching functions you must have a LiteSpeed or OpenLiteSpeed web server with the LSCache module.'=>'要使用缓存功能，您必须拥有带有 LSCache 模块的 LiteSpeed 或 OpenLiteSpeed 网络服务器。','Please enable the LSCache Module at the server level, or ask your hosting provider.'=>'请在服务器级别启用 LSCache 模块，或联系您的托管服务提供商。','Please enable Zinn® Cache Engine in the plugin settings.'=>'请在插件设置中启用 Zinn® 缓存引擎。','LSCache caching functions on this page are currently unavailable!'=>'当前页面上的 LSCache 缓存功能目前不可用！','The network admin selected use primary site configs for all subsites.'=>'网络管理员已为所有子站点选择使用主站点配置。','The following options are selected, but are not editable in this settings page.'=>'以下选项已被选中，但在此设置页面中无法编辑。','LiteSpeed cache plugin upgraded. Please refresh the page to complete the configuration data upgrade.'=>'LiteSpeed 缓存插件已升级。请刷新页面以完成配置数据升级。','Deactivate Zinn® Cache Engine'=>'停用 Zinn® 缓存引擎','The deactivation is temporary'=>'此停用为临时性','Site performance is worse'=>'网站性能变差','Plugin is too complicated'=>'插件过于复杂','Other'=>'其他','Why are you deactivating the plugin?'=>'您为什么要停用该插件？','On uninstall, all plugin settings will be deleted.'=>'卸载时，所有插件设置都将被删除。','If you have used Image Optimization, please %sDestroy All Optimization Data%s first. NOTE: this does not remove your optimized images.'=>'如果您曾使用过图像优化，请先 %s销毁所有优化数据%s。注意：这不会删除您已优化的图像。','Deactivate'=>'停用','Deactivate plugin'=>'停用插件','Close popup'=>'关闭弹窗','Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is installed!'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎插件已安装！','This message indicates that the plugin was installed by the server admin.'=>'此消息表明该插件是由服务器管理员安装的。','The Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is used to cache pages - a simple way to improve the performance of the site.'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine 插件用于缓存页面，这是提高网站性能的一种简单方法。','However, there is no way of knowing all the possible customizations that were implemented.'=>'然而，无法得知所实施的所有可能定制。','For that reason, please test the site to make sure everything still functions properly.'=>'为此，请测试该网站以确保一切功能仍然正常运行。','Examples of test cases include:'=>'测试用例的示例包括：','Visit the site while logged out.'=>'在登出状态下访问该网站。','Create a post, make sure the front page is accurate.'=>'发布一篇文章，确保首页准确无误。','If there are any questions, the team is always happy to answer any questions on the %ssupport forum%s.'=>'如有任何疑问，团队随时乐意在 %ssupport forum%s 上解答您的所有问题。','If you would rather not move at litespeed, you can deactivate this plugin.'=>'如果您不想使用 litespeed，可以停用此插件。','NOTICE: Database login cookie did not match your login cookie.'=>'注意：数据库登录 Cookie 与您的登录 Cookie 不匹配。','If the login cookie was recently changed in the settings, please log out and back in.'=>'如果最近在设置中更改了登录 Cookie，请退出登录并重新登录。','If not, please verify the setting in the %sAdvanced tab%s.'=>'如果没有，请检查 %sAdvanced%s 选项卡中的设置。','If using OpenLiteSpeed, the server must be restarted once for the changes to take effect.'=>'使用 OpenLiteSpeed 时，必须重启服务器一次才能使更改生效。','Unexpected cache rule %2$s found in %1$s file. This rule may cause visitors to see old versions of pages due to the browser caching HTML pages. If you are sure that HTML pages are not being browser cached, this message can be dismissed. (%3$sLearn More%4$s)'=>'在 %1$s 文件中发现意外的缓存规则 %2$s。由于浏览器会缓存 HTML 页面，此规则可能会导致访问者看到页面的旧版本。如果您确信浏览器没有缓存 HTML 页面，则可以忽略此消息。(%3$s了解详情%4$s)','OptimaX Summary'=>'OptimaX 摘要','OptimaX Settings'=>'OptimaX 设置','Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎 OptimaX','Turn on OptimaX. This will automatically request your pages OptimaX result via cron job.'=>'启用 OptimaX。这将通过 cron 任务自动请求您网页的 OptimaX 结果。','CSS Settings'=>'CSS 设置','JS Settings'=>'JS 设置','HTML Settings'=>'HTML 设置','Media Settings'=>'媒体设置','VPI'=>'VPI','Media Excludes'=>'媒体排除项','Localization'=>'本地化','Tuning'=>'调整','Zinn® Cache Engine Page Optimization'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎页面优化','Please test thoroughly when enabling any option in this list. After changing Minify/Combine settings, please do a Purge All action.'=>'启用此列表中的任何选项时，请进行全面测试。更改“压缩/合并”(Minify/Combine)设置后，请执行“全部清除”(Purge All)操作。','Minify CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'压缩 CSS 文件并将 CSS 代码内联。','Combine CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'合并 CSS 文件和内联 CSS 代码。','How to Fix Problems Caused by CSS/JS Optimization.'=>'如何解决由 CSS/JS 优化引起的问题。','Generate unique CSS through an online generation service.'=>'通过在线生成服务生成独特的 CSS。','This will drop the unused CSS on each page from the combined file.'=>'这将从合并的文件中删除每个页面上未使用的 CSS。','Automatic generation of unique CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'通过基于 cron 的队列，在后台自动生成唯一的 CSS。','Filter %s available for UCSS per page type generation.'=>'已针对每个页面类型的 UCSS 生成提供过滤器 %s。','This option is bypassed because %1$s option is %2$s.'=>'由于 %1$s 选项为 %2$s，此选项已被绕过。','Last generated'=>'上次生成','Last requested cost'=>'上次请求费用','URL list in %s queue waiting for cron'=>'%s 队列中等待 cron 执行的 URL 列表','Clear'=>'清除','Run %s Queue Manually'=>'手动运行 %s 队列','Inline UCSS to reduce the extra CSS file loading. This option will not be automatically turned on for %1$s pages. To use it on %1$s pages, please set it to ON.'=>'内联 UCSS 以减少额外的 CSS 文件加载。此选项不会对 %1$s 页面自动开启。若要在 %1$s 页面上使用，请将其设置为开启。','This option will automatically bypass %s option.'=>'此选项将自动绕过 %s 选项。','Include external CSS and inline CSS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of CSS, which should minimize potential errors caused by CSS Combine.'=>'当 %1$s 也启用时，在合并的文件中包含外部 CSS 和内联 CSS。此选项有助于保持 CSS 的优先级，从而最大限度地减少因 CSS 合并可能导致的潜在错误。','Optimize CSS delivery.'=>'优化 CSS 交付。','This can improve your speed score in services like Pingdom, GTmetrix and PageSpeed.'=>'这可以提高您在 Pingdom、GTmetrix 和 PageSpeed 等服务中的速度评分。','Generate critical CSS through an online generation service and load the remaining CSS asynchronously.'=>'通过在线生成服务生成关键 CSS，并异步加载其余的 CSS。','Automatic generation of critical CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'关键 CSS 的自动生成是在后台通过基于 cron 的队列进行的。','When this option is turned %s, it will also load Google Fonts asynchronously.'=>'开启此选项 %s 后，它还将异步加载 Google Fonts。','Elements with attribute %s in HTML code will be excluded.'=>'HTML代码中带有属性 %s 的元素将被排除在外。','This option is bypassed due to %s option.'=>'由于 %s 选项，此选项已被绕过。','Disable this option to generate CCSS per Post Type instead of per page. This can save significant CCSS quota, however it may result in incorrect CSS styling if your site uses a page builder.'=>'禁用此选项可按文章类型生成 CCSS，而不是按页面生成。这可以节省大量的 CCSS 配额，但如果您的网站使用了页面构建器，可能会导致 CSS 样式错误。','This will inline the asynchronous CSS library to avoid render blocking.'=>'这将会内联异步 CSS 库以避免渲染阻塞。','Default'=>'默认值','Set this to append %1$s to all %2$s rules before caching CSS to specify how fonts should be displayed while being downloaded.'=>'将此设置为在缓存 CSS 之前向所有 %2$s 规则追加 %1$s，以指定下载时字体应如何显示。','%s is recommended.'=>'推荐使用 %s。','Swap'=>'切换','Minify HTML content.'=>'压缩 HTML 内容。','Prefetching DNS can reduce latency for visitors.'=>'DNS 预读取可以为访客减少延迟。','For example'=>'例如','Automatically enable DNS prefetching for all URLs in the document, including images, CSS, JavaScript, and so forth.'=>'自动为文档中的所有 URL（包括图片、CSS、JavaScript 等）启用 DNS 预获取。','This can improve the page loading speed.'=>'这可以提高页面加载速度。','Preconnecting speeds up future loads from a given origin.'=>'预连接可加快未来从指定源加载资源的速度。','Delay rendering off-screen HTML elements by its selector.'=>'根据其选择器延迟渲染屏幕外的 HTML 元素。','When minifying HTML do not discard comments that match a specified pattern.'=>'压缩 HTML 时，请勿放弃与指定模式匹配的注释。','If comment to be kept is like: %1$s write: %2$s'=>'如果要保留的评论类似于：%1$s，请写入：%2$s','Remove query strings from internal static resources.'=>'移除内部静态资源的查询字符串。','Google reCAPTCHA will be bypassed automatically.'=>'Google reCAPTCHA 将被自动绕过。','Append query string %s to the resources to bypass this action.'=>'将查询字符串 %s 追加到资源以绕过此操作。','Use Web Font Loader library to load Google Fonts asynchronously while leaving other CSS intact.'=>'使用 Web Font Loader 库异步加载 Google Fonts，同时保持其他 CSS 不变。','This will also add a preconnect to Google Fonts to establish a connection earlier.'=>'这还将添加一个到 Google Fonts 的 preconnect，以便更早建立连接。','Prevent Google Fonts from loading on all pages.'=>'阻止 Google Fonts 在所有页面上加载。','Stop loading WordPress.org emoji. Browser default emoji will be displayed instead.'=>'停止加载 WordPress.org 表情符号。将显示浏览器默认表情符号。','This option will remove all %s tags from HTML.'=>'此选项将从 HTML 中删除所有 %s 标签。','Minify JS files and inline JS codes.'=>'压缩 JS 文件并内联 JS 代码。','Combine all local JS files into a single file.'=>'将所有本地 JS 文件合并为一个文件。','This option may result in a JS error or layout issue on frontend pages with certain themes/plugins.'=>'此选项可能会在具有某些主题/插件的前端页面上导致 JS 错误或布局问题。','JS error can be found from the developer console of browser by right clicking and choosing Inspect.'=>'通过右键单击浏览器并选择“检查”，可以在浏览器的开发者控制台中找到 JS 错误。','Include external JS and inline JS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of JS execution, which should minimize potential errors caused by JS Combine.'=>'当 %1$s 也启用时，在合并的文件中包含外部 JS 和内联 JS。此选项有助于保持 JS 执行的优先级，从而将由 JS 合并潜在引起的错误降到最低。','Deferred'=>'已延期','Delayed'=>'延迟','Deferring until page is parsed or delaying till interaction can help reduce resource contention and improve performance causing a lower FID (Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'推迟到页面解析完成或延迟到交互发生有助于减少资源争用并提升性能，从而降低 FID（Core Web Vitals 指标）。','Failed to create Avatar table. Please follow <a %s>Table Creation guidance from LiteSpeed Wiki</a> to finish setup.'=>'创建头像表失败。请按照 <a %s>LiteSpeed Wiki 中的建表指南</a>完成设置。','Localization Settings'=>'本地化设置','Store Gravatar locally.'=>'本地存储 Gravatar','Accelerates the speed by caching Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars).'=>'通过缓存 Gravatar（全球通用头像）来提升加载速度。','Refresh Gravatar cache by cron.'=>'通过 cron 刷新 Gravatar 缓存。','Avatar list in queue waiting for update'=>'等待更新队列中的头像列表','Run Queue Manually'=>'手动运行队列','Specify how long, in seconds, Gravatar files are cached.'=>'指定 Gravatar 文件缓存的时长（以秒为单位）。','Localize external resources.'=>'本地化外部资源。','Please thoroughly test all items in %s to ensure they function as expected.'=>'请对 %s 中的所有项目进行全面测试，以确保它们按预期运行。','Resources listed here will be copied and replaced with local URLs.'=>'此处列出的资源将被复制并替换为本地 URL。','HTTPS sources only.'=>'仅限 HTTPS 源。','Comments are supported. Start a line with a %s to turn it into a comment line.'=>'支持评论。在一行的开头使用 %s 可以将其变为评论行。','Example'=>'示例','Please thoroughly test each JS file you add to ensure it functions as expected.'=>'请彻底测试您添加的每个 JS 文件，以确保其按预期运行。','Load images only when they enter the viewport.'=>'仅在图片进入视口时加载。','This can improve page loading time by reducing initial HTTP requests.'=>'通过减少初始 HTTP 请求，这可以改善页面加载时间。','Adding Style to Your Lazy-Loaded Images'=>'为延迟加载的图片添加样式','Specify a base64 image to be used as a simple placeholder while images finish loading.'=>'指定一个 base64 图像，用作图片加载完成前的简单占位符。','This can be predefined in %2$s as well using constant %1$s, with this setting taking priority.'=>'这也可以在 %2$s 中使用常量 %1$s 进行预定义，并且此设置具有优先权。','By default a gray image placeholder %s will be used.'=>'默认情况下将使用灰色图像占位符 %s。','For example, %s can be used for a transparent placeholder.'=>'例如，%s 可用于透明占位符。','Responsive image placeholders can help to reduce layout reshuffle when images are loaded.'=>'响应式图像占位符有助于在加载图像时减少布局重排。','This will generate the placeholder with same dimensions as the image if it has the width and height attributes.'=>'如果图像带有宽度和高度属性，这将生成与图像尺寸相同的占位符。','Specify an SVG to be used as a placeholder when generating locally.'=>'指定本地生成时要用作占位符的 SVG。','It will be converted to a base64 SVG placeholder on-the-fly.'=>'系统将实时将其转换为 base64 SVG 占位符。','Variables %s will be replaced with the corresponding image properties.'=>'变量 %s 将被替换为相应的图像属性。','Variables %s will be replaced with the configured background color.'=>'变量 %s 将被替换为已配置的背景颜色。','Specify the responsive placeholder SVG color.'=>'请指定响应式占位符 SVG 颜色。','Generate Low Quality Image Placeholders through an online generation service, for responsive image previews while loading.'=>'通过在线生成服务生成低画质图片占位符，以便在加载时实现响应式图片预览。','Keep this off to use plain color placeholders.'=>'保持关闭此项以使用纯色占位符。','Specify the quality when generating LQIP.'=>'生成 LQIP 时指定质量。','Larger number will generate higher resolution quality placeholder, but will result in larger files which will increase page size and consume more points.'=>'较大的数字将生成更高分辨率质量的占位符，但这会导致文件变大，从而增加页面大小并消耗更多积分。','Changes to this setting do not apply to already-generated LQIPs. To regenerate existing LQIPs, please %s first from the admin bar menu.'=>'对此设置的更改不适用于已生成的 LQIP。要重新生成现有的 LQIP，请先从管理栏菜单中 %s。','pixels'=>'像素','LQIP requests will not be sent for images where both width and height are smaller than these dimensions.'=>'宽高均小于这些尺寸的图片将不会发送 LQIP 请求。','Automatically generate LQIP in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'通过基于 cron 的队列在后台自动生成 LQIP。','If set to %1$s, before the placeholder is localized, the %2$s configuration will be used.'=>'如果设置为 %1$s，在占位符本地化之前，将使用 %2$s 配置。','If set to %s this is done in the foreground, which may slow down page load.'=>'如果设置为 %s，这将在前台执行，可能会减慢页面加载速度。','Size list in queue waiting for cron'=>'Cron 等候队列中的列表大小','Load iframes only when they enter the viewport.'=>'仅在 iframe 进入视口时加载。','Set an explicit width and height on image elements to reduce layout shifts and improve CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'在图像元素上设置明确的宽度和高度，以减少布局偏移并改善 CLS（一种 Core Web Vitals 指标）。','Use %1$s to bypass remote image dimension check when %2$s is ON.'=>'当 %2$s 开启时，使用 %1$s 绕过远程图像尺寸检查。','The image compression quality setting of WordPress out of 100.'=>'WordPress 的图像压缩质量设置（满分 100）。','Automatically replace large images with scaled versions.'=>'自动将大图片替换为缩放版本。','Scaled size threshold'=>'扩展大小阈值','Filter %s available to change threshold.'=>'可用筛选器 %s 以更改阈值。','Listed images will not be lazy loaded.'=>'列出的图片将不会进行延迟加载。','Useful for above-the-fold images causing CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'适用于导致 CLS（Core Web Vitals 指标）的首屏图片。','Elements with attribute %s in html code will be excluded.'=>'带有属性 %s 的 HTML 代码中的元素将被排除。','Images containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'包含这些类名的图片将不会进行延迟加载。','Images having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'具有这些父级类名的图片将不会进行延迟加载。','Iframes containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'包含这些类名的内联框架将不会进行延迟加载。','Iframes having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'拥有这些父级类名的 iframe 不会被延迟加载。','Prevent any lazy load of listed pages.'=>'阻止对所列页面的任何延迟加载。','These images will not generate LQIP.'=>'这些图片将不会生成 LQIP。','Tuning Settings'=>'调优设置','Listed JS files or inline JS code will be delayed.'=>'列出的 JS 文件或内联 JS 代码将被延迟加载。','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'列出的 JS 文件或内联 JS 代码将不会被压缩或合并。','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings.'=>'预定义列表也将与上述设置合并。','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be deferred or delayed.'=>'列出的 JS 文件或内联 JS 代码将不会被延迟加载或推迟执行。','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be optimized by %s.'=>'%s 不会优化所列出的 JS 文件或内联 JS 代码。','Prevent any optimization of listed pages.'=>'阻止对所列页面的任何优化。','Only optimize pages for guest (not logged in) visitors. If turned this OFF, CSS/JS/CCSS files will be doubled by each user group.'=>'仅为访客（未登录用户）优化页面。如果关闭此选项，每个用户组的 CSS/JS/CCSS 文件将会翻倍。','Selected roles will be excluded from all optimizations.'=>'选定的角色将被排除在所有优化之外。','Tuning CSS Settings'=>'调整 CSS 设置','Listed CSS files or inline CSS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'列出的 CSS 文件或内联 CSS 代码将不会被压缩或合并。','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings'=>'预定义列表也将与上述设置合并','Listed CSS files will be excluded from UCSS and saved to inline.'=>'列出的 CSS 文件将被排除在 UCSS 之外并保存到内联。','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in UCSS.'=>'列出其样式应始终包含在 UCSS 中的 CSS 选择器。','Learn more'=>'了解更多','Wildcard %s supported.'=>'支持通配符 %s。','The selector must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'选择器必须存在于CSS中。HTML中的父类将不起作用。','Listed URI will not generate UCSS.'=>'列出的 URI 不会生成 UCSS。','Use %1$s to generate one single UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s while other page types still per URL.'=>'使用 %1$s 为页面类型为 %2$s 的页面生成一个单一的 UCSS，而其他页面类型仍按 URL 生成。','Use %1$s to bypass UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s.'=>'使用 %1$s 来绕过页面类型为 %2$s 的页面的 UCSS。','List post types where each item of that type should have its own CCSS generated.'=>'列出文章类型，该类型的每个项目都应生成自己的 CCSS。','For example, if every Page on the site has different formatting, enter %s in the box. Separate critical CSS files will be stored for every Page on the site.'=>'例如，如果网站上的每个页面都有不同的格式，请在框中输入 %s。网站上的每个页面都将存储单独的关键 CSS 文件。','Separate critical CSS files will be generated for paths containing these strings.'=>'将为包含这些字符串的路径生成单独的关键 CSS 文件。','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in CCSS.'=>'列出其样式应始终包含在 CCSS 中的 CSS 选择器。','Selectors must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'选择器必须存在于 CSS 中。HTML 中的父级类将无法生效。','Specify critical CSS rules for above-the-fold content when enabling %s.'=>'启用 %s 时，请为首屏内容指定关键 CSS 规则。','When you use Lazy Load, it will delay the loading of all images on a page.'=>'启用延迟加载后，它会延迟加载页面上的所有图片。','The Viewport Images service detects which images appear above the fold, and excludes them from lazy load.'=>'视口图片服务可检测哪些图片出现在首屏，并将它们排除在延迟加载之外。','This enables the page\'s initial screenful of imagery to be fully displayed without delay.'=>'这使得页面首屏的图像能够毫无延迟地完全显示。','Enable Viewport Images auto generation cron.'=>'启用视口图片自动生成计划任务。','Standard Presets'=>'标准预设','Import / Export'=>'导入 / 导出','Zinn® Cache Engine Configuration Presets'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎配置预设','Essentials'=>'基础版','Default Cache'=>'默认缓存','Higher TTL'=>'更长 TTL','This no-risk preset is appropriate for all websites. Good for new users, simple websites, or cache-oriented development.'=>'此无风险预设适用于所有网站。适合新用户、简单网站或以缓存为导向的开发。','Only basic caching features are enabled. Every option in this preset works without any online service.'=>'仅启用了基本的缓存功能。此预设中的每个选项均无需任何在线服务即可运行。','Basic'=>'基础版','Everything in Essentials, Plus'=>'包含“基础版”全部功能及更多','Mobile Cache'=>'移动端缓存','This low-risk preset introduces basic optimizations for speed and user experience. Appropriate for enthusiastic beginners.'=>'该低风险预设引入了针对速度和用户体验的基本优化。适合热情的初学者。','Includes optimizations known to improve site score in page speed measurement tools. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'包含已知可提高页面速度测量工具中网站评分的优化功能。其中一些功能需要在线生成服务（此插件未包含该服务），因此这些功能将不生效。','Advanced (Recommended)'=>'高级（推荐）','Everything in Basic, Plus'=>'包含“基础版”、“尊享版”的所有功能','Guest Mode and Guest Optimization'=>'访客模式与访客优化','CSS, JS and HTML Minification'=>'CSS、JS 和 HTML 代码精简','JS Defer for both external and inline JS'=>'外部和内联 JS 的 JS 延迟加载','DNS Prefetch for static files'=>'静态文件的 DNS 预获取','Remove Query Strings from Static Files'=>'移除静态文件的查询字符串','This preset is good for most websites, and is unlikely to cause conflicts. Any CSS or JS conflicts may be resolved with Page Optimization > Tuning tools.'=>'此预设适用于大多数网站，且不太可能引起冲突。任何 CSS 或 JS 冲突都可以通过“页面优化 > 调整”工具来解决。','Includes many optimizations known to improve page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'包含许多已知能提高页面速度得分的优化项。其中有些需要在线生成服务，该服务不包含在本插件中，因此这些优化项将不会生效。','Aggressive'=>'激进','Everything in Advanced, Plus'=>'包含“高级版”和“附加版”的所有功能','CSS & JS Combine'=>'CSS 和 JS 合并','Asynchronous CSS Loading with Critical CSS'=>'使用关键 CSS 异步加载 CSS','Removed Unused CSS for Users'=>'已为用户移除未使用的 CSS','Lazy Load for Iframes'=>'iframe延迟加载','This preset might work out of the box for some websites, but be sure to test! Some CSS or JS exclusions may be necessary in Page Optimization > Tuning.'=>'此预设开箱即可用于某些网站，但请务必进行测试！在“页面优化 > 调整”中，可能需要排除某些 CSS 或 JS。','Extreme'=>'至尊','Everything in Aggressive, Plus'=>'包含“激进”方案的所有功能，外加更多','Lazy Load for Images'=>'图片惰性加载','Viewport Image Generation'=>'视口图像生成','JS Delayed'=>'JS 延迟加载','Inline JS added to Combine'=>'已添加到合并的内联 JS','Inline CSS added to Combine'=>'已添加到 Combine 的内联 CSS','This preset almost certainly will require testing and exclusions for some CSS, JS and Lazy Loaded images. Pay special attention to logos, or HTML-based slider images.'=>'此预设几乎肯定需要对某些 CSS、JS 和延迟加载图像进行测试和排除。请特别注意标志（Logo）或基于 HTML 的滑块图像。','Enables the maximum level of optimizations for improved page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'启用最高级别的优化以提高页面速度评分。其中一些优化需要在线生成服务（此插件未包含该服务），因此这些优化将不会生效。','Zinn® Cache Engine Standard Presets'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎标准预设','Use an official LiteSpeed-designed Preset to configure your site in one click. Try no-risk caching essentials, extreme optimization, or something in between.'=>'使用官方设计的 LiteSpeed 预设，一键配置您的网站。体验无风险的缓存核心功能、极致优化，或介于两者之间的方案。','Who should use this preset?'=>'谁应该使用此预设？','This will back up your current settings and replace them with the %1$s preset settings. Do you want to continue?'=>'这将会备份您当前的设置，并将其替换为 %1$s 的预设设置。是否继续？','Apply Preset'=>'应用预设','unknown'=>'未知','History'=>'历史记录','Error: Failed to apply the settings %1$s'=>'错误：应用设置 %1$s 失败','Restored backup settings %1$s'=>'已恢复备份设置 %1$s','Applied the %1$s preset %2$s'=>'已应用 %1$s 预设 %2$s','Backup created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset'=>'应用 %2$s 预设之前 %1$s 创建的备份','This will restore the backup settings created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset. Any changes made since then will be lost. Do you want to continue?'=>'这将恢复在应用 %2$s 预设之前 %1$s 创建的备份设置。在此之后所做的任何更改都将丢失。是否要继续？','Restore Settings'=>'恢复设置','Zinn® Cache Engine View .htaccess'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎查看 .htaccess','.htaccess Path'=>'.htaccess 路径','Frontend .htaccess Path'=>'前端 .htaccess 路径','Default path is'=>'默认路径为','PHP Constant %s is supported.'=>'PHP 常量 %s 已受支持。','You can use this code %1$s in %2$s to specify the htaccess file path.'=>'您可以在 %2$s 中使用此代码 %1$s 来指定 htaccess 文件路径。','Backend .htaccess Path'=>'后端 .htaccess 路径','Current %s Contents'=>'当前 %s 内容','View .htaccess'=>'查看 .htaccess','Heartbeat'=>'心跳','Debug Settings'=>'调试设置','Log View'=>'日志查看','Zinn® Cache Engine Toolbox'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎工具箱','Heartbeat Control'=>'心跳控制','Disable WordPress interval heartbeat to reduce server load.'=>'禁用 WordPress 心跳间隔以降低服务器负载。','Disabling this may cause WordPress tasks triggered by AJAX to stop working.'=>'禁用此选项可能会导致由 AJAX 触发的 WordPress 任务停止运行。','Turn ON to control heartbeat on frontend.'=>'开启以在前端控制心跳。','Specify the %s heartbeat interval in seconds.'=>'指定以秒为单位的 %s 心跳间隔。','WordPress valid interval is %s seconds.'=>'WordPress 有效间隔为 %s 秒。','Set to %1$s to forbid heartbeat on %2$s.'=>'设置为 %1$s 以在 %2$s 上禁用心跳检测。','Turn ON to control heartbeat on backend.'=>'开启以控制后端心跳。','Turn ON to control heartbeat in backend editor.'=>'开启以在后端编辑器中控制心跳。','Export Settings'=>'导出设置','Export'=>'导出','Last exported'=>'上次导出','This will export all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings and save them as a file.'=>'这将导出所有当前的 Zinn® Cache Engine 设置并将其保存为文件。','Import Settings'=>'导入设置','Import'=>'导入','Last imported'=>'最后导入','This will import settings from a file and override all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings.'=>'这将会从文件中导入设置并覆盖所有当前的 Zinn® Cache Engine 设置。','Reset All Settings'=>'重置所有设置','This will reset all settings to default settings.'=>'这将把所有设置重置为默认设置。','Are you sure you want to reset all settings back to the default settings?'=>'您确定要将所有设置恢复为默认设置吗？','Reset Settings'=>'重置设置','Purge Log'=>'清除日志','Crawler Log'=>'爬虫日志','LiteSpeed Logs'=>'LiteSpeed 日志','Clear Logs'=>'清除日志','Click to copy'=>'点击复制','Copy Log'=>'复制日志','Click to download'=>'点击下载','Download'=>'下载','Purge Front Page'=>'清除首页','This will Purge Front Page only'=>'这将仅清除首页','Purge Pages'=>'清除页面','This will Purge Pages only'=>'此操作将仅清除页面缓存','Purge %s Error'=>'清除 %s 错误','Purge %s error pages'=>'清除 %s 个错误页面','Purge the LiteSpeed cache entries created by this plugin'=>'清除由此外插件创建的 LiteSpeed 缓存条目','This will purge all minified/combined CSS/JS entries only'=>'这将仅清除所有压缩/合并的 CSS/JS 条目','Purge all the object caches'=>'清除所有对象缓存','Reset the entire opcode cache'=>'重置整个操作码缓存','Critical CSS'=>'关键 CSS','This will delete all generated critical CSS files'=>'这将会删除所有生成的关键 CSS 文件','Unique CSS'=>'独占 CSS','This will delete all generated unique CSS files'=>'这将会删除所有生成的唯一 CSS 文件','This will delete all localized resources'=>'这将删除所有本地化资源','This will delete all generated image LQIP placeholder files'=>'这将删除所有生成的图像 LQIP 占位符文件','This will delete all generated Viewport Images'=>'这将删除所有生成的视口图像','This will delete all cached Gravatar files'=>'这将会删除所有缓存的 Gravatar 文件','Purge the cache entries created by this plugin except for Critical CSS & Unique CSS & LQIP caches'=>'清除由此外挂程序创建的缓存项，但“关键 CSS”、“唯一 CSS”和“LQIP”缓存除外','Empty Entire Cache'=>'清空整个缓存','Clears all cache entries related to this site, including other web applications.'=>'清除与此站点相关的所有缓存项，包括其他Web应用程序。','This action should only be used if things are cached incorrectly.'=>'此操作仅在缓存不正确时使用。','This will clear EVERYTHING inside the cache.'=>'这将清除缓存中的所有内容。','This may cause heavy load on the server.'=>'这可能会给服务器带来沉重负载。','If only the WordPress site should be purged, use Purge All.'=>'如果只需清除 WordPress 站点，请使用“全部清除”。','Purge By...'=>'按...清除','Select below for "Purge by" options.'=>'请在下方选择“清除方式”选项。','Category'=>'类别','Post ID'=>'文章 ID','Tag'=>'标签','Purge pages by category name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'按分类名称清除页面 - 例如，应将 %2$s 用于 URL %1$s。','Purge pages by post ID.'=>'按文章 ID 清除页面。','Purge pages by tag name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'通过标签名称清除页面 - 例如，应将 %2$s 用于 URL %1$s。','Purge pages by relative or full URL.'=>'按相对或完整 URL 清除页面缓存。','e.g. Use %1$s or %2$s.'=>'例如：使用 %1$s 或 %2$s。','Purge List'=>'清除列表','Debug Helpers'=>'调试助手','View Site Before Optimization'=>'优化前查看网站','View Site Before Cache'=>'缓存前查看网站','Disable All Features for 24 Hours'=>'禁用所有功能 24 小时','Remove `Disable All Feature` Flag Now'=>'立即移除 `Disable All Feature` 标志','Zinn® Cache Engine is temporarily disabled until: %s.'=>'Zinn® 缓存引擎已暂时禁用，直至：%s。','This will disable LSCache and all optimization features for debug purpose.'=>'这将会出于调试目的禁用 LSCache 以及所有优化功能。','Admin IP Only'=>'仅限管理员IP','Outputs to a series of files in the %s directory.'=>'输出到 %s 目录中的一系列文件。','To prevent filling up the disk, this setting should be OFF when everything is working.'=>'为了防止磁盘空间占满，一切正常时此设置应保持关闭。','The Admin IP option will only output log messages on requests from admin IPs listed below.'=>'管理员 IP 选项只会输出下方列出的管理员 IP 的请求日志消息。','Allows listed IPs (one per line) to perform certain actions from their browsers.'=>'允许列出的 IP（每行一个）从其浏览器执行某些操作。','Your IP'=>'您的 IP','More information about the available commands can be found here.'=>'有关可用命令的更多信息，请参阅此处。','Advanced level will log more details.'=>'高级级别将记录更多详细信息。','MB'=>'MB','Specify the maximum size of the log file.'=>'指定日志文件的最大大小。','Shorten query strings in the debug log to improve readability.'=>'缩短调试日志中的查询字符串以提高可读性。','Only log listed pages.'=>'仅记录所列页面。','Prevent any debug log of listed pages.'=>'阻止列出页面的任何调试日志。','Prevent writing log entries that include listed strings.'=>'阻止写入包含所列字符串的日志条目。','Cache Engine'=>'缓存引擎','Overview'=>'概览','Web server'=>'Web 服务器','not reported'=>'未报告','Version'=>'版本','This server is not running LiteSpeed.'=>'此服务器未运行 LiteSpeed。','Everything else here works — image optimisation, the database cleaner, the CDN — but full-page caching needs LiteSpeed at the web server, so pages are not being cached. Ask your host whether LiteSpeed is available, or move to Zinn® hosting where it is standard.'=>'这里的所有其他功能都可以正常运行——图像优化、数据库清理程序、CDN——但全页缓存需要 Web 服务器上的 LiteSpeed，因此页面无法缓存。请向您的服务商咨询是否提供 LiteSpeed，或者迁移到默认包含该功能的 Zinn® 主机。','See Zinn® hosting'=>'查看 Zinn® 托管','LiteSpeed is running and full-page caching is available.'=>'LiteSpeed 正在运行，且全页缓存可用。','The engine’s own settings — caching, image optimisation, the database cleaner, the crawler and the CDN — live on its own menu. This screen carries the things Zinn Digital® adds: the status above, a report you can send to support, and the shared import and export.'=>'该引擎自身的设置——缓存、图像优化、数据库清理器、爬虫和 CDN——位于其自己的菜单中。此屏幕承载了 Zinn Digital® 添加的内容：上方的状态、可发送给支持团队的报告，以及共享的导入和导出。','Open the cache engine settings'=>'打开缓存引擎设置','Cache settings'=>'缓存设置','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'请参阅 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'已下载的更新未能通过完整性检查，因此未进行安装。','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'已保存。请输入新值进行替换。','Filter this list…'=>'筛选此列表…','Filter this list'=>'过滤此列表','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'没有符合该筛选条件的内容。','Add a row'=>'添加行','Remove this row'=>'删除此行','Remove'=>'移除','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — 概览','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'此网站上的每一个 Zinn® 插件及其工作状态。','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'此插件不需要连接。','Open settings'=>'打开设置','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','Settings sections'=>'设置部分','Support'=>'支持','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Tools'=>'工具','Export settings'=>'导出设置','Reset to defaults'=>'恢复默认设置','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'这会将此插件的所有设置恢复为默认值。是否继续？','Diagnostics for support'=>'支持诊断','Import a settings file'=>'导入设置文件','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'导出的文件中绝不包含密码、令牌或 API 密钥——您需要在新站点上重新输入这些信息。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'此插件的所有设置均已恢复为默认值。','Done.'=>'完成。','That action is not available.'=>'此操作不可用。','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'无法读取该文件。请选择从 Zinn® 插件导出的设置文件。','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'该文件太大，无法作为设置导出。','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'该文件不是 Zinn® 设置导出文件。','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'该文件是从另一个插件 (%s) 导出的，因此在此处导入它会存储此插件无法识别的设置。','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'已导入 %d 个设置。密码和 API 密钥不会包含在导出的文件中，请重新输入。','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接……','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但有些问题需要处理','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'运行在您的账户上','We could not check this'=>'我们无法检查此项','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'该插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'最后检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'（在新标签页中打开）','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'发送至 Zinn® 支持','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'发送的正是这段内容——绝无其他，也绝无隐藏。您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥均不包含在其中。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'将要发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送至 Zinn® 支持团队','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们将为您创建一个支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如果您不想发送，请将其复制并在工单中自行粘贴。','Copied'=>'已复制','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'无法从该服务器 (%s) 连接到 Zinn Digital®。请复制上方的报告并提交工单 —— 您的设置没有任何问题。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® 客服已收到您的报告，并将通过电子邮件回复。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® 客服已收到您的报告（参考编号：%s），并将通过电子邮件回复您。','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'您在短时间内发送了多个报告。请稍候几分钟再试——之前的报告已经送达。','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® 刚才无法接受该报告——这是我们这边的问题，而非您的。请稍后重试，或将上面的报告复制到工单中。','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'报表已被拒绝（HTTP %d）。请将其复制在上方并提交工单，附上该编号。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读 %s 用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® WordPress 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移以及为管理多个网站的人群打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖成熟的网站、域名和链接投放，资金安全托管，直到双方满意为止。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的人','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业者市场：浏览来自作家、设计师、开发人员和 SEO 专家的 10,000 多项现成服务，或者发布项目并让他们竞标。','Style preset'=>'样式预设','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'一个起点。其下的任何内容都会覆盖它。','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'使用我自己的颜色和尺寸','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'关闭此项将完全按原样使用预设。']];